      "id": "claim_61364c3b6131403e890cb76e678403fe",
      "statement": "YAML is a superset of JSON and, as such, is a convenient format for specifying hierarchical configuration data. The SpringApplication class automatically supports YAML as an alternative to properties whenever you have the SnakeYAML library on your classpath.",
