      "id": "claim_d81544d193954578951cc855774dac40",
      "statement": "Spring Framework provides two convenient classes that can be used to load YAML documents. The YamlPropertiesFactoryBean loads YAML as Properties and the YamlMapFactoryBean loads YAML as a Map.",
      "evidence": [
